{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "3b8996aa-6800-47e8-a37c-fineopay-tooauto",
    "name": "TOO AUTO USAGER API - Paiement FineoPay Mobile",
    "description": "Documentation Postman du parcours paiement FineoPay pour l'equipe mobile.\n\nLe mobile utilise uniquement 2 APIs:\n1. `POST /api/v1/store-paiement` pour initier le paiement et recuperer le `checkoutLink`.\n2. `POST /api/v1/paiement/check-statut` pour verifier le statut avec `syncRef`.\n\nLe callback FineoPay reste gere uniquement cote backend:\n`POST /api/v1/fineopay/callback?token=FINEOPAY_CALLBACK_TOKEN`\n\nParcours:\n1. Le mobile appelle `store-paiement`.\n2. Le backend cree le paiement local en `en_attente`, appelle FineoPay et retourne `checkoutLink` + `syncRef`.\n3. Le mobile ouvre `checkoutLink` pour permettre a l'utilisateur de payer.\n4. FineoPay appelle le callback backend.\n5. Le backend met a jour le paiement et active l'abonnement si le paiement est reussi.\n6. Le mobile appelle `paiement/check-statut` avec `syncRef` pour rafraichir l'etat.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "https://votre-domaine.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "api_prefix",
      "value": "/api/v1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "auth_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "user_id",
      "value": "12",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "forfait_id",
      "value": "2",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "amount",
      "value": "5000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "sync_ref",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "checkout_link",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Initier paiement FineoPay",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP 201', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});",
              "",
              "const json = pm.response.json();",
              "",
              "pm.test('Lien de paiement retourne', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(json.status).to.eql('success');",
              "    pm.expect(json.data.checkoutLink).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
              "    pm.expect(json.data.syncRef).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
              "});",
              "",
              "if (json.data) {",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('checkout_link', json.data.checkoutLink || '');",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('sync_ref', json.data.syncRef || '');",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "bearer",
          "bearer": [
            {
              "key": "token",
              "value": "{{auth_token}}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"amount\": {{amount}},\n  \"description\": \"Paiement abonnement Premium\",\n  \"countryCurrencyCode\": \"XOF\",\n  \"customerEmail\": \"client@example.com\",\n  \"customerFirstName\": \"Jean\",\n  \"customerLastname\": \"Kouadio\",\n  \"customerPhoneNumber\": \"0700000000\",\n  \"user_id\": {{user_id}},\n  \"forfait_id\": {{forfait_id}}\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/store-paiement",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "store-paiement"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Appelee par le mobile pour initier le paiement.\n\nLe backend:\n- cree un paiement local `en_attente`,\n- appelle FineoPay,\n- transmet a FineoPay le callback backend avec le token,\n- retourne `checkoutLink` et `syncRef`.\n\nAction mobile apres succes: ouvrir `data.checkoutLink`."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "201 - Lien FineoPay genere",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"amount\": 5000,\n  \"description\": \"Paiement abonnement Premium\",\n  \"countryCurrencyCode\": \"XOF\",\n  \"customerEmail\": \"client@example.com\",\n  \"customerFirstName\": \"Jean\",\n  \"customerLastname\": \"Kouadio\",\n  \"customerPhoneNumber\": \"0700000000\",\n  \"user_id\": 12,\n  \"forfait_id\": 2\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/store-paiement",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "store-paiement"
              ]
            }
          },
          "status": "Created",
          "code": 201,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [
            {
              "key": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ],
          "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"message\": \"Lien de paiement généré avec succès\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"paiement\": {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"referenceNumber\": \"TOO-20260601123000-ABC123\",\n      \"amount\": 5000,\n      \"description\": \"Paiement abonnement Premium\",\n      \"countryCurrencyCode\": \"XOF\",\n      \"customerEmail\": \"client@example.com\",\n      \"customerFirstName\": \"Jean\",\n      \"customerLastname\": \"Kouadio\",\n      \"customerPhoneNumber\": \"0700000000\",\n      \"user_id\": 12,\n      \"forfait_id\": 2,\n      \"statut\": \"en_attente\",\n      \"checkout_link\": \"https://dev.fineopay.com/pay/business123/abc123/checkout\"\n    },\n    \"checkoutLink\": \"https://dev.fineopay.com/pay/business123/abc123/checkout\",\n    \"syncRef\": \"TOO-20260601123000-ABC123\"\n  }\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Check statut paiement",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP 200', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "const json = pm.response.json();",
              "",
              "pm.test('Statut present', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
              "    pm.expect(json.status).to.be.oneOf(['en_attente', 'success', 'failed']);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "bearer",
          "bearer": [
            {
              "key": "token",
              "value": "{{auth_token}}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"syncRef\": \"{{sync_ref}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/paiement/check-statut",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "paiement",
            "check-statut"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Appelee par le mobile apres redirection paiement, ou en polling court, pour savoir si le callback FineoPay a deja confirme le paiement.\n\nStatuts possibles:\n- `en_attente`: paiement pas encore confirme par callback.\n- `success`: paiement confirme et abonnement active.\n- `failed`: paiement echoue."
      },
      "response": [
        {
